Package: saebenchmarking
Title: Title: Benchmarking for Small Area Estimators
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Fiona Audia Nauli", "Sihombing", , "222212612@stis.ac.id", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides model-agnostic difference, ratio, and optimum
    benchmarking for small area estimators together with mean squared
    error estimation, so that small area aggregates are consistent
    with a known external or internal target. Point estimation methods
    follow You and Rao (2002) <doi:...>, Wang, Fuller and Qu (2008)
    <doi:...>, and Rao and Molina (2015, ISBN:...). Mean squared error
    estimation follows Butar and Lahiri (2003) <doi:...>, Steorts and
    Ghosh (2013) <doi:...>, and Datta, Ghosh, Steorts and Maples (2011)
    <doi:...> for Hierarchical Bayes estimators.
